{"meta": {"total": 662, "per_page": 100, "current_page": 1, "last_page": 7, "first_page": 1, "first_page_url": "/?page=1", "last_page_url": "/?page=7", "next_page_url": "/?page=2", "previous_page_url": null}, "data": [{"id": 298, "title": "I Am Living an Unmarried Life With a Terminally Ill Lover", "description": "When a finance genius loses her ability to foresee disasters through touch, she traces its fleeting return to a bloodthirsty swordsman doomed to die. Her pragmatic solution? \"I'll monetize this walking tragedy\", but his adorable misery (\"They sold my favorite stew!\") complicates her cold calculations.", "alternative_names": "\uc2dc\ud55c\ubd80 \uc5f0\uc778\uacfc \ub3d9\uac70 \uc0dd\ud65c \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4 | \uc2dc\ud55c\ubd80 \uc5f0\uc778\uacfc \ube44\ud63c \uc0dd\ud65c \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4", "series_type": "Comic", "series_slug": "i-am-living-an-unmarried-life-with-a-terminally-ill-lover", "thumbnail": "https://media.luacomic.org/file/V4IKlhs/mwwl45y1silod5er6pn01sdu.webp", "total_views": 31958, "status": "Completed", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:20:29.304Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-25T12:36:58.142Z", "badge": "Comic", "rating": 5, "release_schedule": {"sat": true}, "nu_link": null, "is_coming_soon": false, "is_pinned": false, "paid_chapters": [], "free_chapters": [{"id": 23283, "chapter_name": "Chapter  79", "chapter_slug": "chapter-79", "created_at": "2025-11-01T21:39:09.933Z", "series_id": 298, "index": "79.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "1"}}, {"id": 23282, "chapter_name": "Chapter  78", "chapter_slug": "chapter-78", "created_at": "2025-11-01T21:38:31.955Z", "series_id": 298, "index": "78.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "2"}}, {"id": 22831, "chapter_name": "Chapter  77", "chapter_slug": "chapter-77", "created_at": "2025-10-25T17:19:13.494Z", "series_id": 298, "index": "77.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "3"}}, {"id": 22364, "chapter_name": "Chapter  76", "chapter_slug": "chapter-76", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:56:16.027Z", "series_id": 298, "index": "76.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "4"}}, {"id": 22107, "chapter_name": "Chapter  75", "chapter_slug": "chapter-75", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:28:17.164Z", "series_id": 298, "index": "75.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "5"}}], "latest_chapter": null, "meta": {"metadata": {}, "chapters_count": "79"}}, {"id": 219, "title": "The Duke's Darling Daughter-in-Law", "description": "I possessed the body of the no. 1 villainess, Ellie, who was a terrible person who tormented the Male Lead in the orphanage. I quietly waited until the day that the Duke would pick him up vowed to never get caught up in the novel, so she would not see the ugly ending that the villainess did, until...\n\"I will also adopt the child next to him too... she will become my daughter-in-law.\"\nI was adopted along with the Male Lead! I can\u2019t just do this? There\u2019s a separate heroine!", "alternative_names": "\uc785\uc591\ub41c \uba70\ub290\ub9ac\ub294 \ud30c\uc591\uc744 \uc900\ube44\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4", "series_type": "Comic", "series_slug": "the-dukes-darling-daughter-in-law", "thumbnail": "https://media.luacomic.org/file/V4IKlhs/ud87tb3admhhhe5kpdrz39kp.webp", "total_views": 54809, "status": "Hiatus", "created_at": "2025-02-17T20:14:58.754Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-10T18:37:18.072Z", "badge": "Comic", "rating": 5, "release_schedule": {"sat": true}, "nu_link": null, "is_coming_soon": false, "is_pinned": false, "paid_chapters": [], "free_chapters": [{"id": 23798, "chapter_name": "Chapter  112", "chapter_slug": "chapter-112", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:13:09.389Z", "series_id": 219, "index": "112.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "1"}}, {"id": 23538, "chapter_name": "Chapter  111", "chapter_slug": "chapter-111", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:54:46.479Z", "series_id": 219, "index": "111.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "2"}}, {"id": 23249, "chapter_name": "Chapter  110", "chapter_slug": "chapter-110", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:29:30.496Z", "series_id": 219, "index": "110.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "3"}}, {"id": 22355, "chapter_name": "Chapter  109", "chapter_slug": "chapter-109", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:27:55.311Z", "series_id": 219, "index": "109.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "4"}}, {"id": 22106, "chapter_name": "Chapter  108", "chapter_slug": "chapter-108", "created_at": "2025-10-11T19:23:38.712Z", "series_id": 219, "index": "108.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "5"}}], "latest_chapter": null, "meta": {"metadata": {}, "chapters_count": "112"}}, {"id": 215, "title": "The Beast Tamed by the Evil Woman", "description": "The only real villain in the novel, took a handsome man and tamed him for the rest of his life. After putting his fear to the limit, he learned to plead with her, becoming a beast from which he could never escape even if he loosened his leash. However, one day, the beast falls in love and becomes emperor with the woman who saved him, and plunges the evil woman into an eternal bondage.", "alternative_names": "\uc545\ub140\uac00 \uae38\ub4e4\uc778 \uc9d0\uc2b9", "series_type": "Comic", "series_slug": "the-beast-tamed-by-the-evil-woman", "thumbnail": "https://media.luacomic.org/file/V4IKlhs/j328ecq8mrmrpoodmbcibi01.webp", "total_views": 38777, "status": "Completed", "created_at": "2025-02-17T15:26:34.363Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-20T14:48:20.363Z", "badge": "Comic", "rating": 5, "release_schedule": {"sat": true}, "nu_link": null, "is_coming_soon": false, "is_pinned": false, "paid_chapters": [], "free_chapters": [{"id": 34128, "chapter_name": "Chapter 124", "chapter_slug": "chapter-124", "created_at": "2026-06-13T16:24:16.487Z", "series_id": 215, "index": "124.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "1"}}, {"id": 33941, "chapter_name": "Chapter 123", "chapter_slug": "chapter-123", "created_at": "2026-06-06T17:36:52.072Z", "series_id": 215, "index": "123.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "2"}}, {"id": 33363, "chapter_name": "Chapter 122", "chapter_slug": "chapter-122", "created_at": "2026-05-23T17:48:04.597Z", "series_id": 215, "index": "122.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "3"}}, {"id": 32863, "chapter_name": "Chapter 121", "chapter_slug": "chapter-121", "created_at": "2026-05-17T13:44:13.593Z", "series_id": 215, "index": "121.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "4"}}, {"id": 32521, "chapter_name": "Chapter 120", "chapter_slug": "chapter-120", "created_at": "2026-05-09T16:48:53.303Z", "series_id": 215, "index": "120.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "5"}}], "latest_chapter": null, "meta": {"metadata": {}, "chapters_count": "124"}}, {"id": 80, "title": "I\u2019m Done Being a Hero, Even If It\u2019s Retirement", "description": "In this life, I will never live as a hero! Retirement, maybe! \u201cA hero should remain heroic until the end.\u201d Adelia, a knight who dedicated her life to the empire and died as a hero. But when she opened her eyes\u2026 \u2018Nine years old? Me?!\u2019 She was back in her childhood! Back to when her family was still alive before the fall of their house! Alright, this is a chance given by the gods. This time, I will save everyone and enjoy perfect retirement in a quiet place! But then\u2026 \u201dSister!!!\u201d Not only did she awaken the holy sword that had been asleep in the temple for 600 years, \u201cDoes the lady prefer tall men?\u201d \u201c\u2026What?\u201d The Crown Prince, who was her superior in her previous life, is showing interest in her? What is happening! I just want to retire quietly!", "alternative_names": "\uc601\uc6c5\uc740 \ub410\uc5b4\uc694, \uc740\ud1f4\ub77c\uba74 \ubab0\ub77c\ub3c4", "series_type": "Comic", "series_slug": "im-done-being-a-hero-even-if-its-retirement", "thumbnail": "https://media.luacomic.org/file/V4IKlhs/f3tqtuqs1dgihals5z40iglp.webp", "total_views": 63094, "status": "Completed", "created_at": "2024-12-14T00:56:35.422Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-21T21:20:00.959Z", "badge": "Comic", "rating": 5, "release_schedule": {"sat": true}, "nu_link": null, "is_coming_soon": false, "is_pinned": false, "paid_chapters": [], "free_chapters": [{"id": 27085, "chapter_name": "Chapter 100", "chapter_slug": "chapter-100", "created_at": "2026-01-30T13:00:34.314Z", "series_id": 80, "index": "100.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "1"}}, {"id": 26684, "chapter_name": "Chapter 99", "chapter_slug": "chapter-99", "created_at": "2026-01-17T17:26:26.878Z", "series_id": 80, "index": "99.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "2"}}, {"id": 26513, "chapter_name": "Chapter 98", "chapter_slug": "chapter-98", "created_at": "2026-01-12T21:19:28.362Z", "series_id": 80, "index": "98.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "3"}}, {"id": 26512, "chapter_name": "Chapter 97", "chapter_slug": "chapter-97", "created_at": "2026-01-12T21:19:09.316Z", "series_id": 80, "index": "97.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "4"}}, {"id": 26511, "chapter_name": "Chapter 96", "chapter_slug": "chapter-96", "created_at": "2026-01-12T21:18:29.222Z", "series_id": 80, "index": "96.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "5"}}], "latest_chapter": null, "meta": {"metadata": {}, "chapters_count": "100"}}, {"id": 133, "title": "Deadlines Are Raining in the Status Window", "description": "A masterpiece of over 3,000 volumes, I was incarnated into \u201cDawn of Repentance.\u201d Moreover, as the successor to the duke\u2019s family, facing a grim fate, I became my cherished character, \u201cMitchell Nephtis.\u201d But upon opening the status window, the countdown to death was D-3. With the thought that I couldn\u2019t die like this, I somehow managed to survive, and each time I changed the development, experience points were granted?! If that\u2019s the case, I\u2019ll change the original storyline drastically to reap the benefits. Leaving the deceased \u201cMichell Nephtys\u201d aside, I lived as the nanny\u2019s daughter, \u201cEvan Laeff,\u201d doing as told, but missions kept pouring in on the status window, and failure meant death. Now that it\u2019s like this, whether the storyline changes or not doesn\u2019t matter. I will definitely survive and prevail", "alternative_names": "\uc0c1\ud0dc\ucc3d\uc5d0\uc11c \uc2dc\ud55c\ubd80\uac00 \ube57\ubc1c\uce5c\ub2e4, The Countdown of My Death Is Spamming My Status Window", "series_type": "Comic", "series_slug": "deadlines-are-raining-in-the-status-window", "thumbnail": "https://media.luacomic.org/file/V4IKlhs/dm1pod0dvg5fkwb0e5hvops2.webp", "total_views": 45773, "status": "Ongoing", "created_at": "2025-01-26T14:49:34.598Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-01T11:10:38.121Z", "badge": "Comic", "rating": 5, "release_schedule": {"sat": true}, "nu_link": null, "is_coming_soon": false, "is_pinned": false, "paid_chapters": [], "free_chapters": [{"id": 44349, "chapter_name": "Chapter 103", "chapter_slug": "chapter-103", "created_at": "2026-09-26T17:06:54.397Z", "series_id": 133, "index": "103.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "1"}}, {"id": 43418, "chapter_name": "Chapter 102", "chapter_slug": "chapter-102", "created_at": "2026-09-19T19:42:47.613Z", "series_id": 133, "index": "102.0", "chapters_to_be_freed": [], "meta": {"adonis_group_limit_counter": "2"}}, {"id": 41693, "chapter_name": "Chapter 101", "chapter_slug": "chapter-101", "created_at": "2026-09-05T16:37:36.935Z", "series_id": 133, "index": "101.0", "chapte